{"body":"Issue 691, Part A: after orca_worktree.py launch runs, the full launch JSON is also saved as launch-result.json in the issue folder, for a launched and for a failed launch (never for already_launched), best-effort, so a script can read the terminal, layers and release values without reading the claiming agent's text. copy_issue_dir never copies the file into the worktree. Documented in claim.md, SKILL.md and commands/issue.md, with tests.\n\nPart B (session-gov.sh, the observation runbook, superclaude install and the live OB-H2 rerun) is not in this pull request; it waits for pull request 685 and the owner's yes in chat. No rule telling the claiming agent to print the JSON verbatim was added.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","files":[{"path":".dev/tasks/done/TASK-WF-implementPartAOf-20261120-040502/TASK-WF-implementPartAOf-20261120-040502.md","additions":72,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":".dev/tasks/done/TASK-WF-implementPartAOf-20261120-040502/artifacts/codegraph-grounding.md","additions":37,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":".dev/tasks/done/TASK-WF-implementPartAOf-20261120-040502/artifacts/codegraph.md","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":".dev/tasks/done/TASK-WF-implementPartAOf-20261120-040502/artifacts/plan-edits.md","additions":12,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":".dev/tasks/done/TASK-WF-implementPartAOf-20261120-040502/artifacts/retries/T1/prompt-1-1.md","additions":41,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":".dev/tasks/done/TASK-WF-implementPartAOf-20261120-040502/artifacts/retries/T1/q0-head","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":".dev/tasks/done/TASK-WF-implementPartAOf-20261120-040502/artifacts/retries/T2/prompt-2-1.md","additions":39,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":".dev/tasks/done/TASK-WF-implementPartAOf-20261120-040502/artifacts/retries/T2/q0-head","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":".dev/tasks/